MODEL INFORMATION:

  NUMBER OF PARAMETERS
    Outcome Models:         20
    Predictor Models:       12

  PREDICTORS
    Fixed variables:        condition mathpre
    Incomplete ordinal:     frlunch efficacy

  MODELS

   focal.model:
    [1]  mathpost ~ Intercept condition@beta1 frlunch@beta2 efficacy@beta3 
                 mathpre@beta4

   auxiliary.models:
    [2]  atrisk ~ Intercept mathpost condition frlunch efficacy mathpre
    [3]  stanread ~ Intercept atrisk mathpost condition frlunch efficacy mathpre


